      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: require exact claims for direct cloud cleanup",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- require canonical lease IDs before DigitalOcean, Linode, Vultr, or Scaleway resources enter Crabbox inventory\n- require exact provider/account-or-project/resource-bound local claims before reuse, stop, or cleanup\n- keep claimless canonical resources read-only until explicit `--reclaim` adoption; never synthesize destructive ownership from remote tags\n- preserve interrupted-create recovery while validating the exact stored provider identity, and prevent read-only resolve paths from writing claims\n- document the ownership boundary in provider and stop documentation\n\nCloses https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/issues/811\n\n## Verification\n\n- `go test -race ./...`\n- `go vet ./...`\n- `scripts/test-go-modules.sh`\n- `scripts/check-go-coverage.sh 90.0` (90.0%)\n- `node --test scripts/*.test.js` (362 passed)\n- `scripts/check-docs.sh`\n- Worker format, lint, both typechecks, 760 tests, and all dry-run builds\n- deadcode and CLI build\n- autoreview clean after fixing its read-only claim-mutation finding\n\n## Exact-head live proof\n\nCandidate: `ee49c68b6bed9592623457c8859561c0b85650ef`\n\n- DigitalOcean: created `cbx_37e8aad5ea70`, reached SSH-ready, ran `echo ok`, stopped the exact claimed Droplet/key, final inventory `[]`\n- Linode: created `cbx_2535de951358`, reached SSH-ready, ran `echo ok`, stopped the exact claimed instance, final inventory `[]`\n- Scaleway: created `cbx_a9b2bcb0cf78`, reached SSH-ready, ran `echo ok`, stopped the exact project/zone/server-bound instance/key, final inventory `[]`\n- Current-head local proof: status resolves are read-only (`NoLocalStateMutations`) so claimless canonical resources can remain visible to `status` without rewriting claims; targeted race tests, docs check, and `go vet` pass on `ee49c68b6bed9592623457c8859561c0b85650ef`.\n- DigitalOcean/Linode/Scaleway: previous live create/use/stop/empty-inventory proof was collected on `a332ab6b8d36e140757f691ef516d9482bc6f8bf`; rerun on the current head before treating it as exact-head provider proof.\n- Vultr: pending because `VULTR_API_KEY` is unavailable in the maintainer environment; keep this PR unmerged until current-head create/use/stop/empty-inventory proof passes.\n\n",
        "branch": "codex/issue811-provider-ownership",
